<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0F172A', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 38, background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>模块四 · 风险点 = 知识地基（陈松涛）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3B82F6', marginLeft: 12, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>AI 的天花板</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '47%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '12px 16px', background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.10)', borderRadius: 10, borderLeft: '4px solid #3B82F6' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>定位：整套系统判得准不准，<span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>地基说了算</span>。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 风险点(RiskPoint)经 TF-IDF 建索引，是<span style={{ color:'#3B82F6' }}>模块一检索与判定的直接语料</span>。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>垃圾进，垃圾出</span>：风险点质量直接决定 AI 判得准不准。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 格式需与 RAG 索引约定一致（分词/字段），否则检索漏命中。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>因此本模块是「先把教材写好」，再谈 AI 多聪明。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '53%', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <svg width='540' height='320' viewBox='0 0 540 320'>
        <defs>
          <marker id='ar19' markerWidth='9' markerHeight='9' refX='7' refY='3' orient='auto'>
            <path d='M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748B' />
          </marker>
        </defs>
        <rect x='130' y='14' width='280' height='54' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#8B5CF6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='38' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>模块一 检索 / 判定</text>
        <text x='270' y='56' textAnchor='middle' fill='#C4B5FD' fontSize='12'>AI 的聪明程度</text>
        <rect x='160' y='110' width='220' height='50' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#3B82F6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='134' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>TF-IDF 索引</text>
        <text x='270' y='152' textAnchor='middle' fill='#93C5FD' fontSize='12'>建库 / 召回</text>
        <rect x='150' y='210' width='240' height='70' rx='10' fill='rgba(59,130,246,0.14)' stroke='#3B82F6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='236' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='16' fontWeight='bold'>风险点 RiskPoint</text>
        <text x='270' y='258' textAnchor='middle' fill='#93C5FD' fontSize='13'>知识地基 · 质量决定上限</text>
        <line x1='270' y1='68' x2='270' y2='110' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar19)' />
        <line x1='270' y1='160' x2='270' y2='210' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar19)' />
      </svg>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 18px', background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(59,130,246,0.16), rgba(139,92,246,0.05))', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.35)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>答辩亮点</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17.5, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>先把「教材」写扎实：风险点质量直接决定 AI 判定的天花板，地基稳，上层才立得住。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>实战避错系统 · 团队分工</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>19 / 25</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
